    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What it works out",
      "items": [
        "y = reverse(filter(reverse(filter(x))))",
        "Every frequency comes out where it went in",
        "The peak of a heartbeat does not move, and the edge of a step does not lean"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "How the library gets there",
      "items": [
        "Whatever the filter held back going forward, it holds back again going back",
        "The two shifts are equal and opposite, thus they cancel exactly",
        "Nothing about the filter itself is changed to make this work"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "What you must know",
      "items": [
